The {{Term/Store|Soldier's Set||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="CaC 184"/><ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Soldier's Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Soldier's Helm]], [[Soldier's Armor]], and [[Soldier's Greaves]]. All three pieces are sold at [[Ventest Clothing Boutique]] in [[Hateno Village]]. As the standard armor of [[Hyrule]]'s [[Soldier]]s, it has much higher defense than other [[Armor]] pieces, but it does not feature any [[Set Bonus]]es.

Certain [[Hylian]]s wear parts of the Soldier's Set, such as the Helm being worn by [[Hoz]] and [[Savelle]]. [[Nell]] also wears the Soldier's Armor.

